<title>UK: RHEINHYP prices 500 mln mark bond due August 2003. [CORRECTED 12:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>RHEINHYP prices 500 mln mark bond due August 2003. [CORRECTED 12:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from &quot;Depfa prices 1.5 bln mark  bond due March 2003&quot;).</p>
<p>The following fungible bond has been priced, joint lead managers Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINHYP RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    26.AUG.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  96.045    PAY DATE    09.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     REOFFER    95.87     SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND JULY 2003 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCHED 19.FEB.97 AS A 1.0 BLN DEM ISSUE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
